<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average jumped 80.36 to 8,254.89, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite index rose 5.14 points to 493.57, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share added 48 cents.</p>
<p>Advancing issues beat decliners 2,066 to 833.</p>
<p>Volume was 568,478,300 compared with 544,539,520 on Tuesday.</p>
